# Agent Ignore — Files to Skip

## Never read, modify, or reference these paths:

# Auto-generated / build artifacts
.next/
node_modules/
.vercel/
dist/
build/
coverage/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Logs and history (read-only — never modify manually)
.ai-context/prompt_history.md

# OS / Editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
.idea/
.vscode/settings.json

# Secrets — never touch
.env
.env.local
.env.production
.env*.local

## Notes
- You MAY read `.env.example` — it contains only placeholder values
- You MAY read `prompt_history.md` for context but ONLY append, never rewrite
